# Session-local Claude Code state (identity, WTF recorder, scratch)
.claude/*
# Per-phase wave plans, committed (one v3 plan per phase Plan)
!.claude/phases/
# wave-status writes phases-waves.json AND runtime state.json/flights.json here;
# only the plan is committed
!.claude/status/
.claude/status/*
!.claude/status/phases-waves.json
